      "content": "Answer the following question with a single MySQL SQL query against the current database. Explore the semantic network and verify with mysql_query as needed. The SELECT list must contain exactly the columns the question asks for, in the asked order. When the final SQL is verified, call the submit_SQL tool with it.\n\nThe following hints are provided to help you write the SQL:\n\n## Gold Tables\n- FCLT_ORG_DLC_KEY\n- FCLT_ORGANIZATION\n- FCLT_ROOMS\n- COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED\n- ACADEMIC_TERMS\n\n## Column Mapping\n- department: FCLT_ORGANIZATION.HR_DEPARTMENT_NAME, COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED.DEPARTMENT_NAME\n- department name: FCLT_ORGANIZATION.HR_DEPARTMENT_NAME, COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED.DEPARTMENT_NAME\n- average area: FCLT_ROOMS.AREA\n- area range: FCLT_ROOMS.AREA\n- area variance: FCLT_ROOMS.AREA\n- rooms assigned to department: FCLT_ROOMS.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY, FCLT_ORGANIZATION.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY\n- rooms with area greater than 40: FCLT_ROOMS.AREA\n- average total units: COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED.TOTAL_UNITS\n- total units range: COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED.TOTAL_UNITS\n- total units variance: COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED.TOTAL_UNITS\n- subjects offered in regular academic terms: COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED.TERM_CODE, ACADEMIC_TERMS.TERM_CODE, ACADEMIC_TERMS.IS_REGULAR_TERM\n\n## Join Keys\n- FCLT_ORGANIZATION.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY <-> FCLT_ORG_DLC_KEY.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY\n- FCLT_ORGANIZATION.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY <-> FCLT_ROOMS.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY\n- ACADEMIC_TERMS.TERM_CODE <-> COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED.TERM_CODE\n\n## Subquery Decomposition\n1. For each department, give the department name and calculate the average, range, and variance of the area of rooms assigned to it, considering only rooms with an area greater than 40.\n```sql\nSELECT o.HR_DEPARTMENT_NAME, AVG(r.AREA) AS avg_area, MAX(r.AREA) - MIN(r.AREA) AS area_range, VARIANCE(r.AREA) AS area_variance FROM FCLT_ORG_DLC_KEY d JOIN FCLT_ORGANIZATION o ON d.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY = o.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY JOIN FCLT_ROOMS r ON o.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY = r.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY WHERE r.AREA > 40 GROUP BY o.HR_DEPARTMENT_NAME ORDER BY area_range DESC;\n```\n2. For each department, give the department name and calculate the average, range, and variance of the total units for subjects offered in regular academic terms.\n```sql\nSELECT c.DEPARTMENT_NAME, AVG(c.TOTAL_UNITS) AS avg_total_units, MAX(c.TOTAL_UNITS) - MIN(c.TOTAL_UNITS) AS total_units_range, VARIANCE(c.TOTAL_UNITS) AS total_units_variance FROM COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED c JOIN ACADEMIC_TERMS t ON c.TERM_CODE = t.TERM_CODE WHERE t.IS_REGULAR_TERM = 'Y' GROUP BY c.DEPARTMENT_NAME ORDER BY total_units_range DESC;\n```\n\n## Question\nFor each department, show the department name, the average, range, and variance of the area of rooms assigned to it (considering only rooms with an area greater than 40), as well as the average, range, and variance of the total units for subjects offered in regular academic terms, listing the department name, average area, area range, area variance, average total units, total units range, and total units variance in that order. Do not return any rounded answers."
