      "content": "Phase 1 complete. Key entities found:\n\n- **Tables**: FCLT_ORG_DLC_KEY, FCLT_ORGANIZATION, FCLT_ROOMS, COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED, ACADEMIC_TERMS (plus related: SPACE_UNIT, SPACE_DETAIL, FAC_ROOMS, HR_ORG_UNIT, SIS_DEPARTMENT, SUBJECT_SUMMARY, SUBJECT_OFFERED_SUMMARY, ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL)\n- **Metrics**: dw_4061 (very similar shape), dw_1488, dw_1833, dw_1465, dw_2151, dw_41, dw_3417, dw_2597\n- **Concepts**: concept_room_space_inventory, concept_facility_organization_dimension, concept_subject_offering_facts, concept_academic_term_dimension, concept_course_catalog_sources, concept_department_dimension, concept_dept_hr_org_hierarchy\n- **Column concepts**: column_concept_total_units, column_concept_department_name, column_concept_term_code, column_concept_facility_organization_key, column_concept_dlc_key\n\nNow Phase 2 — investigating entities:\n\n",
